OL,3,ABlue Planet and Gandhi composer George
OL,4,AFenton dies aged 76
OL,5,
OL,6,FComposer George Fenton, whose work
OL,7,Fincluded music for films such as
OL,8,FGandhi, Groundhog Day and The Fisher
OL,9,FKing, as well as TV shows like Planet
OL,10,FEarth and Bergerac, has died at the age
OL,11,Fof 76.
OL,13,FThe prolific musician received five
OL,14,FOscar nominations for his film scores,
OL,15,Fincluding those for Dangerous Liasions
OL,16,Fand Cry Freedom.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
