OL,3,ABlue Planet and Gandhi composer George
OL,4,AFenton dies aged 76
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis work on the BBC TV show Blue Planet
OL,7,Falso earned awards from the Baftas,
OL,8,FEmmy Awards and Ivor Novellos; and he
OL,9,Falso composed theme music for BBC News
OL,10,Fprogrammes such as Newsnight and
OL,11,FBreakfast Time.
OL,13,FIn a statement, Fenton's family said:
OL,14,F"We are very sad to announce that
OL,15,FGeorge Fenton passed away unexpectedly
OL,16,Ftoday."
